1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,340
This is the implementation demo for journey nine.

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:07,350
It is the real application and API running on this machine,

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:12,800
with synthetic people and the local payment adapter, so nothing is ever charged.

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,570
It shows how a buyer adds a body shop review to a mechanic inspection.

5
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:22,250
A buyer starts a booking and enters the car's details.

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:27,030
On the review step there are three choices: mechanic, body shop, or both.

7
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:30,430
Body shop alone costs the same as a mechanic review.

8
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:33,900
Both adds twenty dollars, so the order shows seventy.

9
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,340
Now the schedule step.

10
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:40,050
A combined call needs a mechanic and a body shop on the same video call,

11
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:43,000
so only times when both are free are offered.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,770
Here the mechanic is free from the hour and the body shop from half past,

13
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:52,090
so a single shared time appears, and picking it names both people.

14
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:57,460
The buyer pays and is booked, and the confirmation says both will inspect the car.

15
00:00:57,460 --> 00:01:00,860
The inspection shows the mechanic and the body shop.

16
00:01:02,010 --> 00:01:05,960
Slots can be asked for by kind: mechanic, body shop, or both,

17
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:11,130
and a combined slot exists only where both providers are free at the same start.

18
00:01:11,130 --> 00:01:15,400
Holding a combined time takes both slots together, all or nothing.

19
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:19,730
If a second buyer asks for the same time, the answer is a conflict,

20
00:01:19,730 --> 00:01:21,670
and nothing is left half held.

21
00:01:21,670 --> 00:01:25,680
Once the call is booked, the shared time is no longer offered.

22
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:28,840
If the paid review does not match the held times,

23
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:33,370
the booking is refused without refunding, so the buyer can pick again.

24
00:01:33,370 --> 00:01:37,250
Cancelling releases both slots, and rescheduling moves both.

25
00:01:37,250 --> 00:01:42,360
These rules are written down as an architecture decision, and covered by tests.

26
00:01:43,510 --> 00:01:45,270
Here is what to remember.

27
00:01:45,270 --> 00:01:49,790
Body shop alone is the base price, and both adds twenty dollars.

28
00:01:49,790 --> 00:01:54,800
A combined call needs a mechanic and a body shop free at the same time.

29
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:57,830
Both slots are held together or not at all.

30
00:01:57,830 --> 00:02:01,220
Next, journey ten: join a live video inspection.
